<name>Transmission/Transaxle</name>
<section id="1002B_S001H" variety="S001H">
<name>Automatic Transaxle</name>
<ttl id="1002B_S001H_74Y0X_T00H8" variety="T00H8">
<name>Electronically Controlled Automatic Transaxle [ECT] (U660E)</name>
<para id="RM000002BOC009X" category="C" type-id="3037S" name-id="261I6-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P0746/62</dtccode>
<dtcname>SL1 Solenoid Circuit (Performance)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002BOC009X_04" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FSF00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The transmission control computer detects the gear position from the signals of the transmission revolution sensor (NT) and (NC). </ptxt>
<ptxt>When the detected gear position differs from the commanded gear position, the transmission control computer detects a mechanical problem in the related solenoid valve, valve body or automatic transmission.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.34in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.84in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0746/62</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>While driving in D range with ATF temperature -10°C or higher (no malfunction of SL1, SL2, SL3, SL4, solenoids, transmission revolution sensor (NT, NC) or fluid temperature sensor is detected)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>(a) or (b)</ptxt>
<ptxt>(a). Shifts to neutral when downshifting from 5 or 6 gear</ptxt>
<ptxt>(b). Does not upshift to 4 gear or higher</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>(a): 0.5 seconds or more</ptxt>
<ptxt>(b): 0.8 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>2 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Clutch control solenoid No.1 (SL1)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission wire</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission Valve Body Assembly </ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Torque Converter Assembly </ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Transaxle Assembly </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
